Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.12,0:01:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(新证据显示有一名青少年幸存)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.64,0:01:35.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安 各位先生 各位女士 我是机长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, good evening, ladies and gentlemen. This is your pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.48,0:01:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系上安全带的指示灯已经亮起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, you'll notice the "fasten seatbelt" sign is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:39.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正经过乱流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're passing through a bit of turbulence here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:44.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不幸 我们无法飞高或飞低\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, we can't get up over it and, uh, we can't get underneath it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.96,0:01:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以请忍耐 我们会尽快通过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just hang in there. We'll get through this as soon as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:49.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么事 - 我能换位子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes? - Can I have a different seat, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.96,0:01:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚机位全满 先生 你恐怕得坐在原位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm afraid we're full tonight, sir. You're gonna have to stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.72,0:02:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会逼你帮助他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to make you help him...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.64,0:02:32.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你是最后一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because you're the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.76,0:02:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:46.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的一定得换座位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I really need to change this seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:49.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我爱莫能助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:53.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有惧高症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid of heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:55.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这么胆小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be a pussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.72,0:03:01.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:07.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不公平 我差一点就逃出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not fair! I was almost out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:56.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.76,0:04:29.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会逮到你的 甜心 还有你的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get you, my pretty, and your little soul too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(榆树街1427号)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.60,0:05:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(出售 春木房仲)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:09.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.28,0:06:24.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:58.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(售票亭)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.80,0:07:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一张 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One ticket...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.76,0:07:03.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来回票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...round trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.64,0:07:06.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.84,0:07:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能错过这班巴士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't wanna miss the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:37.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴士在开动的时候不能尖叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. No screaming while the bus is in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:42.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:46.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(欢迎来到春木市)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:18.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在当只小乖狗去捡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now be a good little doggie and go fetch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:03.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(提神药)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:10.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(克鲁格太太依旧下落不明)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.80,0:09:26.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(青少年收容所)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:28.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(仅限员工出入)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.08,0:09:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史宾瑟 我要确定你了解整个情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spencer, I wanna make sure that you understand our situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个星期后你说会离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In one week, you walk out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你回家之后行为有所改善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I expect to see some changes in your behavior when you get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.24,0:09:51.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你听得很清楚 我带你来这里因为我别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're hearing me. I put you in here because you gave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 下次我就永远把你丢在这里 - 谢谢你来看我 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Next time, I'll leave you here and walk away. - Thanks for the visit, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.40,0:10:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真会调教我儿子 原本我以为他会改善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice job on my kid. I expected to see some improvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是一辆车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He isn't a Toyota.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个王八蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:18.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸来告诉我回家之后要遵守哪些规定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad came by to lay down some ground rules for when I come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.28,0:10:20.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再逃跑或放火烧他的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more running away, no more setting his cars on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了炸掉车库以外还有别的方式能引人注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are ways to get attention besides blowing up the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他连眼睛都没眨一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he barely even blinked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只希望我长大后能变成他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All he wants me to do now is grow up to be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成为他的翻版\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An exact copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.60,0:10:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想玩美式足球或和女同学约会时强暴她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't feel like playing football and date-raping coeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.44,0:10:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你迟早得面对你的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of these days, you'll have to face your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧我在史宾瑟房间找到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what I found in Spencer's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钢管炸弹是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pipe bomb, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个啊 我是在向其他人示范一些生存技巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, that? Well, I was just showing the kids some survival techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我整星期都忙着没收这些玩意儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been confiscating stuff like this all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.28,0:10:56.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些从哪里来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do they get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:59.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这个和其他武器一起放到楼下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put this downstairs with the rest of the arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.28,0:11:02.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 警方应该销毁这些东西 - 警方应该做很多事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The police were to dispose of it. - Police are supposed to do a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:04.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跑 给我回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop. Come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.36,0:11:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别碰我 - 崔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take your hands off me! - Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.00,0:11:08.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 等等 出了什么问题 - 她殴打另外一个小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the problem? - She was beating on one of the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.84,0:11:11.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他想吃我豆腐 - 她不喜欢别人碰她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He was trying to hit on me. - She doesn't like to be touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天要上我的课 对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a session today, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得上医生的课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have Doc's class.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.60,0:11:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去和他协调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Work around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:20.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.44,0:11:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看过这只毒虫吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seen this junkie before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.80,0:11:29.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 他是新面孔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he's new.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:33.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可好了 今天下午又要去少年监狱填表格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful. Another afternoon shot doing juvie paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这么麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screw that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.60,0:11:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接带他去收容所吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just scoop him up and take him to the shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:39.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让那些好心人应付他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the bleeding hearts do the typing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 崔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Come on, Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:45.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样此对了 她真猛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Oh, yeah, she's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,群众都超爱她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crowd Ioves her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:50.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她准备赢得重量级拳击比赛的世界冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's getting ready for the heavyweight champion boxing match of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.12,0:11:54.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧她出拳真猛 你流汗的时候真性感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, hey, look at her go. You know, you are sexy when you sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.60,0:11:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你休想占我便宜 卡洛斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't getting none, Carlos. You ain't getting none.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:12:02.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不会打一个残障人士吧 - 这样就叫残障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wouldn't hit a guy with a handicap. - You call it a handicap?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.84,0:12:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为你是娘炮 来单挑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call it chicken, man. Come on, let's spar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快点 放马过来 - 别闹了 崔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, you yellow-bellied... Come on. - Forget it, Trace. I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.20,0:12:15.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别退缩 你为何不回嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tune out. Why don't you talk back to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:18.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像你跟你老爸顶嘴吗 告诉你 史宾瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you talk back to your father? Let me tell you something, Spence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.92,0:12:23.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发现回嘴有害健康 我就闭上嘴 你懂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stopped talking back when it became hazardous to my health. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.28,0:12:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 都准备好了吗 - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So are we set? - Yeah, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经把钱给司机 只要在黎明前完成我们就自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave the driver our cash. As long as we do it before dawn, we're free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.24,0:12:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这表示我们下礼拜就能去加州吃香喝辣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, that means we're gonna be living large in Cali before the week is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.80,0:12:36.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好十拿九稳 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better be sure, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:40.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我 我都安排好了 我比你更想离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me. I got all the bases covered. I need to get out of here more than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你无法了解我多想离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know shit about needing to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.52,0:12:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你生来家财万贯 富家子弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your family's a picnic, rich boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为我是自愿和你们这些白痴厮混吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I hang around with you morons by choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少你爸爸没设计你和他女朋友的姊姊上床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father didn't try to set you up with his girlfriend's older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.52,0:12:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别提到我爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk to me about fathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.20,0:12:53.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也来探望你了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yours come to visit too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:56.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 每次我闭上眼睛的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, every time I close my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 这样可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, that did it. Yep. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.60,0:13:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最喜爱的学生又被逮到殴打其他小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They caught one of your star pupils beating up on one of our kids again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.12,0:13:19.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 崔西 - 我以为你说她有进步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tracy? - You said you were making progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.60,0:13:21.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我每星期只教这些孩子23分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only get 23 minutes a week with these kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:24.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间这么少 她没宰了他就算万幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With that kind of attention, we're lucky she didn't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:28.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身为治疗师 你的态度真积极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha, ha. Oh, that's a good attitude for a therapist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.40,0:13:31.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗 崔西脑海中埋藏着深沉的创伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Tracy's got some deep trauma buried inside of her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传统治疗不会奏效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conventional therapy is not going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.60,0:13:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梦境治疗就有效吗 你真是个嬉皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And dream therapy is, huh? You're such a hippie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.08,0:13:41.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能经由梦境直达这些孩子们的内心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I can reach these kids through their dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.04,0:13:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我一个机会 我就能解决你的小问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a chance, I can help with your little problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.68,0:13:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有小问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have a little problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是不断做同样的梦 而且我能应付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just have a little reoccurring dream and I'm handling it fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是领钱来解梦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are not being paid to be a dream doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:55.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我几乎没领薪水 所以我得做我认为正确的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm barely being paid. That's why I gotta do what I think is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:13:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是新的吗 - 你喜欢吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is new. - You like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.92,0:14:02.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些是远古的梦境恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are ancient dream demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:02.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据说他们在活人的梦境里游走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Supposedly, they roam the dreams of the living...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:11.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到找到最邪恶变态的人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...till they find the most evil, twisted human imaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:15.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后他们就给此人越界的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then they give him the power to cross the line...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.72,0:14:18.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将我们的噩梦化为现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and turn our nightmares into reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.44,0:14:21.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬 警方又带来一个年轻人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggie, cops just brought in another kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:24.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的状况很糟 好几天没睡 严重失忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real mess. Hasn't slept for days, bad case of amnesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:27.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们需要你立即评估\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need your evaluation right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.44,0:14:34.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你多久没睡了 - 久到我记不得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long have you been awake? - As far as I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:37.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 大约三天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. About three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.12,0:14:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来像是三个礼拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks more like three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.68,0:14:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 这就是失忆症的美妙之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, that's the wonder of amnesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.28,0:14:47.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你永远搞不清楚状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just always keeps you guessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从哪里来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.44,0:14:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:57.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只知道无论我来自哪里 都是最后一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I know is that wherever I'm from, I was the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.56,0:15:00.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 最后一个什么 - 生还者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The last what? - Survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 你有咖啡因药丸或咖啡吗 或是可乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, do you have any, um, caffeine pills or coffee, maybe some Coke?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.00,0:15:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是指汽水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I meant the soda.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.72,0:15:15.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:30.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你为何要醒着 - 因为如果我睡着 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why do you wanna stay awake? - Because if I fall asleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就再也醒不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... I'm not waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你为何这样想 - 这不是我的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why do you think that? - I don't think it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是一种感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.44,0:15:42.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我睡着 说会有麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I fall asleep, there's gonna be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.12,0:15:47.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(克鲁格太太依旧下落不明)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春木市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Springwood."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.04,0:15:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Water tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:16:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,墙上有4567瓶啤酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four thousand, five hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,墙上有67瓶啤酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And sixty-seven bottles of beer on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.44,0:16:12.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,墙上有4567瓶啤酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four thousand, five hundred sixty-seven bottles of beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:17.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若其中一瓶啤酒掉下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If one of those bottles should happen to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.28,0:16:19.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a case of...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:24.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若你再不闭嘴 我就用酒瓶砸爆你的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, I'll break a bottle over your head if you don't shut the fuck up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:33.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,墙上有4567瓶啤酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four thousand, five hundred and sixty-six bottles of beer on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会说出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.92,0:17:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来了 记得应该怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're it. Remember what you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.76,0:17:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要擒抱我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta tag me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:04.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.80,0:17:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:10.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来爸爸这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:45.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:47.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:50.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会说出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我走 白痴 我是你的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Free me, you idiot! I'm your fucking memory!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:55.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.12,0:19:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王八蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.04,0:19:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你梦到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you dreaming about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.56,0:19:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.52,0:19:10.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一栋房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个小女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.60,0:19:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和那篇报导里的小镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something about, uh, the town from my article.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:18.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得有一座水塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember a water tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你记得那篇报导从哪里来的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The article, do you remember where you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.60,0:19:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不记得 - 那个小女孩长什么模样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - The little girl, what did she look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 棕发和红色缎带 - 红色缎带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Brown hair with red ribbons. - Red ribbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况不妙 你和他的梦境有关联\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like it. There's some connection between your dreams and his dreams...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.60,0:19:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而他的梦境是噩耗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and his dreams mean bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你认为我疯了 但我能感觉到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I'm crazy, but I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.28,0:19:48.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里为何没人能谈一些梦境以外的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't anybody talk about anything but dreams around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.32,0:19:51.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我受不了这些胡说八道 - 你不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sick of hearing about this bullshit. - You don't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.56,0:19:54.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为你能解开这个男孩的谜题 进一步帮助自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you can solve this puzzle, it can help with yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.52,0:19:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有谜题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have a puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:01.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有 虽然你自认无所不知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you do. And although you think you know everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你或许还没准备好面对这男孩要让你看见的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you may not be ready to face what this boy is gonna show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.44,0:20:07.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没说过想回去 - 我治疗过失忆症息者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I never said I wanted to go back there. - I've dealt with amnesiacs before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.12,0:20:11.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带你回春木市会引发一些你记忆中的片段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taking you to Springwood is gonna trigger some spark to help you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:15.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要回忆说知道 那是一个烂地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need a spark to help me to remember that it was a bad place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.32,0:20:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去你自己去 我要留在这里快乐地继续失忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a spark, you go. I'll stay here, sparkless but happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:21.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和你一起去 别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be right there with you. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.68,0:20:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯利 我要借用一下厢型车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kelly, gonna take the van for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:27.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(爬虫类青少年龌龊收容所)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.76,0:20:32.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(春木市 两英里)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.36,0:20:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(欢迎来到春木市 人口 15265 居住的好地方)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.36,0:20:58.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫你别让我睡着 这个要求很过分吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you not to let me fall asleep. Is that too much to ask for?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.00,0:21:04.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 回去 - 天啊 靠边停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go back. - Oh, my God. Pull over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:07.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子 孩子 醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John. John, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.08,0:21:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 糟糕 - 这可好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit. - Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:17.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真高兴和你在这里见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny meeting you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:19.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的开车技术真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, nice driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.24,0:21:22.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在这里搞什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.16,0:21:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真棒的计划 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great plan, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.48,0:21:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 差点就成功了 - 我真不敢相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- lt almost worked. - I can't believe you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:30.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们竟然耍这种花样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pulling a stunt like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.80,0:21:31.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.04,0:21:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得先找到电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, the first thing we have to do is find a telephone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.04,0:21:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后你们打给凯利 告诉他你们在哪里 懂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call Kelly and tell him where you are, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着我再想办法送你们回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then we have to figure out how to get you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:42.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有在听吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.72,0:21:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别对我吼 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't scream at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.92,0:21:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是你的驾驶技术差点害死我们 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- lt was your driving that almost killed us. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:02.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(春木镇市集今天登场)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.56,0:22:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(春木镇市集)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.92,0:22:11.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(成人75分钱 儿童十分钱)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.08,0:22:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个一块钱 快来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two. Two for a dollar, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.32,0:22:20.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 两个只要一块钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them here. Here you go. Two for a dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.24,0:22:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 你们先找电话打给凯利和他说你们没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. First I want you to find a phone, call Kelly and tell him you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.64,0:22:29.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我要你们回车上直接开回收容所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to get in that van and drive straight back to the shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们办得到吗 还是我得报警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think you can handle that, or do I have to call the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.84,0:22:38.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别碰他们 - 你滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get away from them. - You go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.60,0:22:41.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- "还是我得报警" - 走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Or do I have to call the police?" - Go away. Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.40,0:22:44.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她又不是我妈 - 她脱掉胸罩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She ain't my mother. - There goes the bra.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.24,0:22:48.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁要吃蜜桃馅饼 味道还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who wants some peach cobbler here? It's not burned too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.28,0:22:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接从中间切开即可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can just cut it right in the middle there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.60,0:22:58.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这里 就是这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step right up here. Right here. Here's the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.00,0:23:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来这里准没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the place you wanna be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.08,0:23:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有小孩 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There are no kids. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.24,0:23:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市集居然没有小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A town fair and there are no kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.28,0:23:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.12,0:23:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在那里做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, what the heck you doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.12,0:23:20.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 史宾瑟 - 电话故障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's up, Spence? - This phone's out of order.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.48,0:23:22.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这座小镇也不对劲 - 一点都没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So is this town. - You are not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.08,0:23:28.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是漂亮又讨人喜欢的小孩子 你们愿意来和我们住吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, what beautiful, adorable children. Would you like to come and live with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.12,0:23:32.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家里很久没有小孩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been so long since we've had children in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.44,0:23:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证这次会不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time, I swear it'll be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.64,0:23:40.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我会把你们小心藏好 他就永远找不到你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time, I'll be careful and I'll hide you better so that he'll never find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.12,0:23:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 我抓到你的鼻子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lookie, I got your nose. Lookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.04,0:23:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ethel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.92,0:23:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要我的孩子回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want my children back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.68,0:23:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他们会把他带来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know they bring him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.60,0:24:02.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你们干的好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, see what you done did?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.40,0:24:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.12,0:24:06.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们好像在演《双峰》 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're in Twin Peaks here. - Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.88,0:24:08.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们热闹看够了吗 - 够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have we seen enough? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.32,0:24:09.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.20,0:24:14.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 回车上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Come on, back in the van.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.36,0:24:17.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是个非常好的主意 - 立刻上车 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know, that's a very good idea. - Now. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.56,0:24:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望他们能顺利回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope they make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.84,0:24:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去听听学校的人有何说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see what they can tell us at the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.68,0:24:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 某人敲响那些钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Somebody rang those bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.84,0:24:34.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们真幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.28,0:24:53.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔西 后面有一张地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trace, there's a map back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.48,0:24:54.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有说我需要地图吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I say I needed a map?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.92,0:24:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忘不了那些人看我们的眼神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't get over the way those people were looking at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.72,0:24:59.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 真诡异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.24,0:25:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}TRACY. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.92,0:25:14.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真有一套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice going.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.28,0:25:16.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天才才会沿着原路绕圈圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It takes talent to travel in a complete circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.92,0:25:19.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且你让我头晕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're making me dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.76,0:25:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.48,0:25:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你非抽不可吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.92,0:25:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是只毒虫 你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're such a heigh-ho, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.04,0:25:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不抽这玩意儿 我需要保持感官敏锐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't play that shit. I need all the senses I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.60,0:25:30.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这玩意儿熄灭 你每十秒钟就抽一根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put that fucking thing out. It's hard enough staying awake...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.60,0:25:33.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让人很难保持清醒 - 这能让我放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...without you lighting up every 10 seconds. - This relaxes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.76,0:25:36.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能用这两根手指让你放松 我直接戳死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can relax you with these two fingers. I'll just puncture your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.16,0:25:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还会把座椅弄脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mess up these seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.80,0:25:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要打一炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to get laid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.00,0:25:42.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你需要地图了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like the map now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.64,0:25:45.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 我不需要任何地图 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I don't need any map. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.12,0:25:47.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当然不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.24,0:25:59.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你为何停下来 - 你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why'd you stop? - Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.00,0:26:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.84,0:26:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地图给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.76,0:26:37.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少罗嗦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.92,0:26:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡洛斯 我说我要看地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlos, I asked you for the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.96,0:27:10.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.84,0:27:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡洛斯 我说我要看地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlos. I asked you for the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.80,0:27:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.28,0:27:25.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地图写说我们完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, the map says we're fucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.96,0:27:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 你有过两次机会 现在轮到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, look, you've had two chances. Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.92,0:27:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 呆头鹅 - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dickhead. - Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.28,0:27:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(春木高中)
