Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.60,0:39:43.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(春木市孤儿院)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.48,0:39:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不应该来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shouldn't even be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.64,0:39:52.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该是来调查你的背景 不是死掉杀人狂的小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're supposed to be finding out about you, not some dead killer's kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.52,0:39:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两者可能是同一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We might be talking about the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.28,0:39:58.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整座小镇的人开口闭口都是克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, the whole town is obsessing on this Krueger character.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.20,0:40:00.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别再提他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you start.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.24,0:40:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们为何要怕我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why else would they be afraid of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.00,0:40:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何我还活着 其他人全都死光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why else am I still alive when everybody else is dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.92,0:40:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳吧 跳吧 跳跃的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skip, skip, skip to my Lou.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.60,0:40:12.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳跃的灵魂 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skip to my Lou, my darlin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.20,0:40:19.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳吧 跳吧 跳跃的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skip, skip, skip to my Lou.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.52,0:40:21.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳跃的灵魂 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skip to my Lou, my darlin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.80,0:40:24.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛莎 不要跑 大家手牵手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Martha, no running. Everyone, hold hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.84,0:40:26.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳吧 跳吧 跳跃的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skip, skip, skip to my Lou.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.56,0:40:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们回来了 真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you've come back. How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.72,0:40:32.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还记得我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.96,0:40:37.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然记得 小男孩 每个小孩我都记得很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, of course, I do, my boy. I remember every one of my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.52,0:40:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特别是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.52,0:40:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时你是个漂亮的小女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a pretty little girl you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.36,0:40:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得你和你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I remember you and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.20,0:40:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你记得克鲁格的孩子吗 - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you remember the Krueger child? - Ha, ha. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.04,0:40:50.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.92,0:40:53.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能揭露孩子的真实身分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not permitted to disclose a child's real identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.88,0:40:57.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛莉莎 你要把球让给芭比玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Melissa. Melissa. You must let Bobby have the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.76,0:40:59.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 孩子 - 过来 没关系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- John. - Come here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.76,0:41:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all right. You share.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.08,0:41:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道谁光着脚丫子 让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder who has a little bare footie around here. Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.72,0:41:08.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁格 可能是凯文或凯尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}K. Krueger? Could mean anything from Kevin to Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.52,0:41:11.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意思只是这里有一个叫这个名字的小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All it really means is there was a child here by that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.28,0:41:13.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.88,0:41:15.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.40,0:41:17.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Oh, look....
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.28,0:41:19.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是他的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm his kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.12,0:41:22.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他让我活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why he's kept me alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.92,0:41:24.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想和我玩变态的游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's trying to play some sick game with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.12,0:41:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了 好吗 他死了 你不是他的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is dead, all right? He's dead and you're not his kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.40,0:41:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.40,0:41:33.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她记得我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She remembered me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.92,0:41:37.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也记得我 和另外50个幻想出来的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She remembered me too and 50 other imaginary friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.92,0:41:38.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们离开这里吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.36,0:41:43.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来画画 今天一整天都还没画画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's draw a picture. We haven't drawn a picture all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.64,0:41:47.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 一笔一画 很好玩吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go. Clippety-clop, clippety-clop. Isn't that fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.12,0:41:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 玛姬 - 崔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maggie. - Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.08,0:41:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不敢相信能找到你 - 你为何还在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't believe I found you. - What are you still doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.08,0:42:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找不到卡洛斯 史宾瑟在一栋旧房子里喝酒 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't find Carlos and Spencer's wasted at this old house and...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.92,0:42:02.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得比佛莱迪早一步找到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get to them before Freddy does.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.92,0:42:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 - 佛莱迪是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Who's Freddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.44,0:42:06.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 路上再说 快点 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll tell you on the way. Come on! - Yeah. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.96,0:42:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.16,0:42:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 再说一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.92,0:42:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的大脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.12,0:42:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你嗑药后的大脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your brain on drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.04,0:42:35.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有问题吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.64,0:42:39.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有 你嗑了什么药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. What are you on?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.28,0:42:42.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来只是一把平底锅和几颗鸡蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like a frying pan and some eggs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.96,0:42:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史宾瑟 咱们去神游吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Spence, let's trip out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.76,0:42:57.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.16,0:43:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- In-A-Gadda-Da-Vida 亲爱的 - 哇啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- In-A-Gadda-Da-Vida, honey - Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.36,0:43:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道我爱你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you know that I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.36,0:43:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,In-A-Gadda-Da-Vida 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In-A-Gadda-Da-Vida, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.44,0:43:29.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道我永远是对的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you know that I'll always be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.24,0:43:37.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.56,0:43:39.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他想必睡着了 - 你们俩找这里和楼上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He must've fallen asleep. - Look here and upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.08,0:43:42.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我去楼下找 - 他们已经不在这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna look downstairs. - They're not here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.80,0:43:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你行行好可以吗 去找就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just humor me, will you, please? And look.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.40,0:43:51.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.20,0:43:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳起来 男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.44,0:43:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.08,0:43:57.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.84,0:43:58.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.48,0:44:04.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 像我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad? - Be like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.80,0:44:05.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be like me. Be like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.16,0:44:08.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听爸爸的话准没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father knows best.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.72,0:44:11.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别打了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.76,0:44:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和你不一样 我也不想变成你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not like you. I don't wanna be like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.96,0:44:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不像你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.00,0:44:23.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.12,0:44:26.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我要加强火力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm playing with power.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.72,0:44:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.36,0:44:36.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级史宾瑟 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Super Spencer. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.64,0:44:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,画面真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, great graphics.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.20,0:44:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来到这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.96,0:44:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡洛斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlos?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.36,0:45:04.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.96,0:45:11.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找到史宾瑟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found Spencer!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.20,0:45:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 把他压住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Hold him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.32,0:45:21.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.28,0:45:25.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 老天爷 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold on. Hold on. - Jesus Christ. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.80,0:45:27.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事 - 他被困在噩梦中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's happening? - He's stuck in a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.04,0:45:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他被狠狠地殴打 - 赶快叫醒他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's kicking the shit out of him. - Well, wake him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.96,0:45:33.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他吸太多大麻了 - 史宾瑟 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's too wasted. - Spencer. Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.52,0:45:34.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.56,0:45:37.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们必须救他出来 - 压住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get him out. - Hold him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.00,0:45:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要进入他的梦中 在他丧命之前救他出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go into his dream, try and bring him out before he gets killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.32,0:45:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快点按住他 - 这太疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. Hold him. - That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.12,0:45:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这算什么 很理智吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what do you call that, rational?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.80,0:46:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左 右 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, left. Right, left. Right, left.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.04,0:46:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他快被整死了 - 我必须进入梦里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's getting trashed. - I have to go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.44,0:46:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Freddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.36,0:46:30.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪不会伤害我 我是他的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy won't hurt me. I'm family.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.16,0:46:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 你要怎么进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so how are you gonna go in?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.28,0:46:34.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.72,0:46:37.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须打昏我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you're gonna have to lay me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.88,0:46:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 搞什么 - 他妈的快点打昏我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is... - Come on, just fucking lay me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.32,0:46:42.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 医生说要用不同的方式 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second. Doc told me a different way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.56,0:46:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别罗嗦 动手说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no time to talk. Just do it!
