Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.88,0:47:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过有更容易的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you I knew an easier way.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.24,0:47:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生总是说要专心冥想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Concentration and meditation." That's what Doc always says.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.00,0:47:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里太神奇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.76,0:47:17.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喷溅 - 那是他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Splat. - Is that him?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.24,0:47:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳起来 男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.44,0:47:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 史宾瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit. Spencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.92,0:47:33.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 孩子 放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, John. Let go of me. Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.60,0:47:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻离开这里 崔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here. Now, Tracy. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.44,0:47:38.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘了拿能量手套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you forgot the Power Glove.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.20,0:47:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 王八蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.08,0:48:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像我一样 像我一样 像我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be like me. Be like me. Be like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.92,0:48:05.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史宾瑟 不要 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spencer, do...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.64,0:48:19.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真想不到 我获得最高分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know? I beat my high score.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.16,0:48:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.56,0:48:44.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新办正事的感觉太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great to be back in business.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.80,0:48:46.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都得感谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.36,0:48:56.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸一直在等你 小女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy's waiting for you, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.92,0:48:58.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭上你的臭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut the fuck up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.52,0:49:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.12,0:49:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.20,0:49:10.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.92,0:49:13.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史宾瑟死了 我无法阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spencer's gone. I couldn't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.08,0:49:15.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子还在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John's still in there.
