Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.96,0:49:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你振作一点 我们要怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, snap out of it! What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.52,0:49:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要把他抬起来离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna pick him up and we're gonna get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.00,0:50:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别又来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.60,0:50:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会再落入他的陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not gonna get me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.52,0:50:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论如何我都不会离开这张床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing is gonna make me get off this bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.12,0:50:39.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.64,0:50:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我恨这栋房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.80,0:50:55.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(欢迎来到春木市 人口 15265)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.76,0:50:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(居住的好地方)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.24,0:51:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(出现紧急状况请拉绳子)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.00,0:51:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.12,0:51:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.52,0:51:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你为何放我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know why you let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.68,0:51:57.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为我是你老爸吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, do you think I'm your daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.20,0:52:03.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.84,0:52:09.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你让我活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you let me live.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.84,0:52:13.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到你带我女儿回来为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only long enough for you to bring me back my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.08,0:52:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.36,0:52:25.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在她要带我去一座新游乐场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now she's gonna take me to a whole new playground.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.56,0:52:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.24,0:52:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备降落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grounded!
