Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.60,0:52:57.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 玛姬 发生什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, Maggie. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.00,0:52:59.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点玛姬 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Maggie. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.96,0:53:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快点离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here. Let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.36,0:53:09.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's...It's not a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.76,0:53:12.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's....
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.32,0:53:18.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须立刻离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We gotta get out of here. Now. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.68,0:53:22.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点玛姬 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Maggie. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.60,0:53:24.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须立刻离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.44,0:53:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘了你从哪里来的 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You forgot where you came from, kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.48,0:53:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我知道你要去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I know where you're going. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.36,0:53:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(欢迎来到春木市 人口数 7741)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.88,0:53:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去旅行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's traveling time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.16,0:53:59.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}TRACY. Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.64,0:54:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 玛姬 快点上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wro... Maggie, get in the van. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.88,0:54:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点上车 我们要离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, get in the van! We gotta get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.16,0:54:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.68,0:54:11.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.36,0:54:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论发生了什么事都不是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever happened, it wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.60,0:54:49.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我甚至不在场 - 一定会再发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wasn't even there, man. - It's gonna happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.28,0:54:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡洛斯 崔西和史宾瑟 躲在厢型车的后座\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlos, Tracy, and Spencer stowed away in the back of the shelter van.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.12,0:54:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们想逃走 你相信吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were trying to escape. Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.40,0:54:58.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就叫他们去打电话 他们应该打给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I took them to the phone. They were supposed to call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.44,0:55:00.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无名氏和我则去学校查看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John Doe and l were gonna check out the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.88,0:55:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但崔西和我们走散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Tracy got separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.56,0:55:06.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 然后他们说逃走了 - 你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And then they ran away. - What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.56,0:55:09.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说卡洛斯 史宾瑟 和那个无名氏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking about Carlos and Spencer and the John Doe.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.64,0:55:11.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯利 他们就这样凭空消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kelly, they just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.64,0:55:15.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你处理太多案件了 玛姬 那些孩子从未来过这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been handling too many cases, Maggie. Those kids were never here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.24,0:55:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若有新来的孩子我会记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would remember any new arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.32,0:55:21.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯利 48小时前 我带来一个无名氏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kelly, I'm talking about 48 hours ago. I brought you a John Doe.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.56,0:55:24.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别告诉我你不记得 是你处理太多案件了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't remember? You're the one who's handling too many cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.72,0:55:27.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去休 急吧 玛姬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get some rest, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.56,0:55:31.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.04,0:55:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们回去 没人记得那孩子或卡洛斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we got back and no one remembers John or Carlos.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.64,0:55:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彷佛他们从未存在过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like they never existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.76,0:55:42.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直听见奇怪的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been hearing strange shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.92,0:55:46.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像某些人梦见卡洛斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like some of the kids are dreaming about Carlos.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.04,0:55:49.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们却不记得他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they don't even remember him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.72,0:55:54.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.72,0:55:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.40,0:56:00.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我能控制我的梦 我不会被你看见的东西所愚弄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I can control my dreams. I'm not fooled by this thing you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.12,0:56:02.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 佛莱迪 - 无论他是什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Freddy. - Whatever he is...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.12,0:56:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在操控梦境与现实的界线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he's fucking with the line between dreams and reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.16,0:56:09.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不仅杀死卡洛斯和其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't just kill Carlos and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.00,0:56:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还抹灭他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He erased them.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.48,0:56:30.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是男孩 不是男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a boy. It's not a boy. It's not a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.40,0:56:57.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.92,0:57:02.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.40,0:57:22.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.40,0:57:29.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你准备好杀人了 - 我是要自卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're getting ready to kill somebody. - Defend myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.84,0:57:34.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要操控的是你的心智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your mind he'll go for.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.84,0:57:37.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你的恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.44,0:57:41.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I knew it, I knew it, I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.40,0:57:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(领养判决书)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.00,0:57:48.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬 你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggie? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.20,0:57:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.20,0:57:54.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 给我 - 我一定要知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me have that. - I have to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.72,0:57:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道他们是谁 他们不肯告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I don't know who they were. They wouldn't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.88,0:58:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们规定彼此不能接触\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have rules about no contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.56,0:58:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们接触过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, there's been contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.16,0:59:11.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样此对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're it. You're it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.56,0:59:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来爸爸这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.40,0:59:18.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会说出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.48,0:59:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.36,0:59:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪 求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fred, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.48,0:59:32.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会说出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.92,0:59:36.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要谈一谈 萝莉塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to talk, Loretta.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.96,0:59:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进屋去 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go inside, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.80,0:59:46.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会说出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I won't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.04,0:59:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫你别乱碰我的东西 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you never to go near my things.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.05,0:59:50.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是故意的 佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I didn't mean to, Fred...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.08,0:59:53.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right? Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.00,0:59:55.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.48,0:59:58.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.84,1:01:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.76,1:01:14.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是个小艺术家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were such a little artist.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.92,1:01:16.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.08,1:01:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.72,1:01:26.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.52,1:01:28.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我的亲骨肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.08,1:01:33.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你能带我出去 在你的脑海中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only you could have brought me out, in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.60,1:01:35.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你不可能是我爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can't be my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.00,1:01:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把你从我身边带走 但我让他们付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They took you away from me, but I made them pay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.64,1:01:45.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我夺走他们所有的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took all their children away from them.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.08,1:01:48.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.48,1:01:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.72,1:01:54.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.20,1:02:03.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收容所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The shelter.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.24,1:02:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该重来一次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to start all over again.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.96,1:02:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这里不是春木市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this isn't Springwood.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.04,1:02:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每座城市都有一条榆树街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every town has an Elm Street.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.16,1:02:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(榆树街)
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.72,1:02:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.40,1:02:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.76,1:03:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔西小乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tracy, girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.08,1:03:02.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy's home.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.92,1:03:06.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 你死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.20,1:03:12.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回家了 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm home, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.44,1:03:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来和我打声招呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come say hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.32,1:03:28.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.32,1:03:41.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 让爸爸爽一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Give Daddy some honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.60,1:03:49.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人会知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one has to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.60,1:03:59.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是我爸爸 你不是我爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not my daddy. You're not my daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.60,1:04:03.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样 崔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.24,1:04:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.64,1:04:12.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你爱我了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you love me now?!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.76,1:04:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你爱我了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you love me now?! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.08,1:04:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.44,1:04:21.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My daddy's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.08,1:04:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.04,1:04:25.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dea...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.40,1:04:30.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不让爸爸爽一下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No honey for Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.64,1:04:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这年头的小孩是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's with kids today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.28,1:04:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不懂得尊重长辈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.20,1:04:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你再也吓不了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't scare me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.48,1:04:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好说大声一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you better speak up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.28,1:04:49.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想必是我的耳朵聋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, must be my deaf ear.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.92,1:05:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有哈本事尽管使出来 贱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kung fu this, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.88,1:05:09.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的梦 我想怎样都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my dream and I do what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.92,1:05:15.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这或许是你的梦 但是规则由我订\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It might be your dream, but it's my rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.04,1:05:38.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生 我需要找医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc. I need to talk to Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.12,1:05:41.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好 - 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.52,1:05:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(请勿奔跑)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.36,1:05:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tracy?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.00,1:05:58.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tracy?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.44,1:06:03.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tracy?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.24,1:06:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 医生 是你吗 - 对 崔西 你在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Doc. Doc, is that you? - Yeah, Tracy, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.12,1:06:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在其中一个置物柜里 快点放我出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm over here in one of the lockers. You gotta get me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.68,1:06:36.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在哪里 - 我在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where the hell are you? - Right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.52,1:06:41.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你教她很多东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You taught her a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.28,1:06:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但她要学的还有很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's so much more to learn.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.28,1:06:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样如何 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about this, Doc?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.80,1:07:21.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棍子和石头或许能让我骨折\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sticks and stones may break my bones...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.84,1:07:25.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但没有任何东西杀得了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but nothing will ever kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.36,1:07:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我想想看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's see now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.92,1:07:33.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们先想烧死我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First they tried burning me. Ha, Ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.88,1:07:39.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后想埋葬我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then they tried burying me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.32,1:07:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这是我的最爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this, this is my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.08,1:07:54.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们甚至试过圣水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They even tried holy water.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.84,1:08:03.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我此是死不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I just keep on ticking.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.24,1:08:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这是他们给我的承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because they promised me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.60,1:08:10.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们 - 梦境中的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They? - The dream people.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.28,1:08:13.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我这份工作的那些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ones that gave me this job.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.24,1:08:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在梦境中 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In dreams...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.40,1:08:20.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我永生不死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... I am forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.24,1:08:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜你没办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too bad you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.88,1:08:42.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.96,1:08:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.20,1:08:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想出消灭他的办法了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I've got a way to get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.56,1:08:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么计划 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's the plan, Doc?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.84,1:08:55.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 你无法在梦中杀死他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. - You can't get him in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.72,1:08:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但若这能出来 他就能出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if this can come out, he can come out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.00,1:09:02.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若他能出来 说会流血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if he can come out, he can bleed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.72,1:09:04.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 然后死去 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And die. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.48,1:09:06.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我何时逮到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How will you know when I got him?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.24,1:09:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会用监测器找到你然后带你出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna find you with this and then I'm bringing you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.24,1:09:11.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须紧抓着他 把他拖出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you've got to be holding him to carry him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.72,1:09:12.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.96,1:09:15.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会试着欺骗你 就像他欺骗崔西一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, he's gonna try and trick you like he tricked Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.68,1:09:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也会用你的双眼愚弄你 你要使用这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's gonna try to use your eyes to fool you. You'll use these.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.44,1:09:21.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 少来 - 你想活命吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get the hell out of here. - You wanna live?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.40,1:09:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些在这里毫无意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These mean nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.56,1:09:27.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但在梦中你想怎样都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in the dream, they can be anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.40,1:09:29.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他进入你的脑中 你也进入他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He got inside of your head, you get inside of his.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.16,1:09:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的任务 对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my job, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.40,1:09:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点 他很了解怎么做最能伤害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful. He's good at finding out what hurts the most.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.56,1:09:39.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 因此你得带我和你一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Exactly. - That's why you gotta take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.48,1:09:40.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.16,1:09:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须是我和他的对决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gotta be me and him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.80,1:09:48.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.00,1:09:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我进去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put me in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.40,1:09:57.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把她接上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strap her in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.28,1:09:59.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.76,1:10:01.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.40,1:10:03.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好 - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.80,1:10:06.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.92,1:10:07.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...nine...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.88,1:10:10.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...eight...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.36,1:10:13.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七 六\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...seven, six...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.40,1:10:15.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五 四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...five, four...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.48,1:10:18.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三 二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...three, two...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.40,1:10:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...one.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.40,1:10:57.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(艾默森郡博物馆)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.20,1:11:22.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进入他的脑中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And get inside his brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.32,1:13:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我进入他的记忆里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in his memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.84,1:13:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一百个疯子的小孩 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a hundred maniacs Son of a hundred maniacs.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.76,1:13:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一百个疯子的小孩 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a hundred maniacs Son of a hundred maniacs.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.76,1:13:58.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.20,1:14:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.68,1:14:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.36,1:14:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好了没有 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready for it, boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.72,1:14:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从我收容你的那天起 你就是个废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been a waste since the day I took you in.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.32,1:14:23.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你该吃药了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it's time to take your medicine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.28,1:14:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.20,1:14:34.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以再抽我一下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I have another?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.20,1:14:42.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想知道痛苦的秘密吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna know the secret of pain?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.64,1:14:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦停止感受 就能开始加以利用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you just stop feeling it, you could start using it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.20,1:14:57.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杀小孩的凶手 - 禽兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Child murderer! - Beast!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.72,1:14:59.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.12,1:15:12.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.64,1:15:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道你要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.60,1:15:19.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要拥有一切 - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want it all! - Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.60,1:15:23.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那就敞开心胸 - 你就会永生不死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then open up. - And you shall be forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.64,1:15:53.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.28,1:16:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另太担心 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.24,1:16:09.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈必须吃药 因为她偷看爸爸特殊的作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy just had to take her medicine for snooping in Daddy's special work.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.44,1:16:15.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你不会说出去 对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you won't tell, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.00,1:16:17.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会说出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't tell.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.80,1:16:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你说出去了 对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you did tell, didn't you? Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.84,1:16:36.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在该你吃药了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now it's time to take your medicine.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.28,1:16:43.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀死我的母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed my mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.36,1:16:51.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她抓到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.48,1:16:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点把她拉出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get her out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.60,1:17:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抓住你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.64,1:17:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抓住你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.40,1:17:26.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抓住他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.64,1:17:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.88,1:17:33.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 或许这段旅程让他丧命 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe the trip killed him. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.24,1:17:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我还是看得见梦境中的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'm still seeing things the way I did in my dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.08,1:17:38.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没结束 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not over. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.84,1:17:50.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警察应该拿走这些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cops were supposed to pick this stuff up.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.96,1:17:54.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好他们没拿走 我们需要用各种武器攻击他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be glad they didn't. We're gonna have to hit him with everything we've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.04,1:17:57.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.80,1:17:59.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这把刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check out this knife.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.80,1:18:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 摆一边去 - 太小了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, put that away. - That's too small.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.40,1:18:09.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这应该可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess so.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.88,1:18:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定它够大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure that's big enough?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.84,1:18:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还是认为他会出现 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Still believe he's gonna show up, huh? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.52,1:18:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔西 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Tracy. Over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.40,1:18:21.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能感觉到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.96,1:18:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你真实存在 - 这不是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're real here. - It wasn't my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.64,1:18:58.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并不是 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.00,1:19:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也看见他们在我小时候 如何对待我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw what they did to me when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.40,1:19:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看得很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.56,1:19:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I loved you...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.72,1:19:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.72,1:19:13.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很努力当个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried so hard to be good.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.72,1:19:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.12,1:19:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但当他们把你从我身边夺走 这是不对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when they took you from me, it wasn't right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.20,1:19:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I knew you'd believe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.00,1:19:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来爸爸这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.20,1:19:41.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.40,1:19:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.64,1:19:45.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.96,1:19:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggie, watch out.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.76,1:19:55.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 钥匙在哪里 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the key? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.08,1:19:58.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,锁被卡住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lock's jammed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.52,1:20:02.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要手 就能杀死你妈那个贱女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't need a glove to kill your bitch of a mother...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.40,1:20:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我也不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I don't need one now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.84,1:20:17.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 放手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.12,1:20:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点放手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.40,1:20:23.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不要 不要 - 下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! No! - No! Get down.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.68,1:20:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我示范给你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you how.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.04,1:20:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像你示范给我母亲和卡洛斯看吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you showed my mother and Carlos?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.72,1:20:39.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有史宾瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Spencer?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.68,1:20:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 手套还给爸爸 小公主 - 你休想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give Daddy the glove back, princess. - Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.16,1:20:47.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.24,1:20:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手套还给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it to me. Give me that glove.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.08,1:20:55.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手套还给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the glove.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.44,1:20:58.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In your dreams.
